# The Rust nightly used for the console ports (Switch, PS Vita), which need -Zbuild-std.
#
# Keep it pinned: a floating `nightly` breaks these builds whenever a dependency such as
# `unwinding` stops compiling on the newest compiler. Every console build script, the build image
# and the CI workflows read this file. To move to a newer nightly, change it here, build both
# ports, then commit.
RFVP_CONSOLE_NIGHTLY=nightly-2026-02-01
